                  "text": "SAIS Abu Dhabi offers rolling admissions throughout the year, subject to seat availability, and accepts students from diverse nationalities and academic backgrounds.\n\nOur admissions team provides personalized support to families throughout the application process, ensuring a smooth transition into the SAIS community. We invite prospective parents and students to visit our campus, meet our faculty, and discover how SAIS fosters academic excellence, character development, and global citizenship from KG through Grade 12."
